{
  "bookId": "rewind-35",
  "id": "chapter-138",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "32508001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "初次见面，我是冈田家的小女儿，冈田彩音。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32508002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "和我一决胜负吧——如果赢了我，我就把参赛名额让给你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32508003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "我是仓田家的真乃。为什么要特地和我对决？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32508004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "你不会不知道吧……我家的笨蛋哥哥可是把你的堂哥仓田龙马，视作宿命般的劲敌啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32508005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "如果作为妹妹的我击败了那个龙马的妹妹，那我可就胜过哥哥啦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32508006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "原来是这样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32508007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "怎么样，接受我的提议吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32508008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "好，我接受。可是主办方会允许吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32508009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田彩音",
          "text": "既然是非正规的格斗赛事，这点小事应该没问题。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32508010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可以去找负责人阿尔弗雷德。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32508011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "那我们现在去找他吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32508012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "噢噢，真乃的眼睛里好像燃烧着斗志？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32508013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "不，我只是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32508014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "……嗯，我确实想参赛，想战胜仓田龙马。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32508015",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "哎？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿尔弗雷德",
          "text": "实习生，什么风把你吹来了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "有件事情要和你商量。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509003",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "主人将彩音的提议告诉了阿尔弗雷德。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿尔弗雷德",
          "text": "可以，我同意了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "怎么这么干脆？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿尔弗雷德",
          "text": "仓田家和冈田家的小女儿之间的对决……作为卖点拿来宣传也能吸引不少人气吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "考虑的重点居然是可以宣传的卖点吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿尔弗雷德",
          "text": "别太天真了，实习生，不要忘了这次活动的目的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿尔弗雷德",
          "text": "那么，作为明日正赛的预热，今天下午会新增一场资格赛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿尔弗雷德",
          "text": "做好必要的准备，特别是你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "诶，我？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿尔弗雷德",
          "text": "资格赛会在正式的擂台上公开进行，你们应该清楚规则吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "知道，参赛选手必须穿泳装。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "所以接下来的任务……是给真乃买一套泳装吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "32509018",
              "text": "交给我吧。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "32509017",
              "text": "交给绿子吧。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "32509016",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "我？还是你更合适吧，我对打扮可一窍不通。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32509018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "|101|，拜托你了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-727",
