      ],
      "title": "泳装对决·Ⅰ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "32510001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "哇……好多不同款式的泳装，不知道该怎么选了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "选一套你喜欢的吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "欢迎光临，有什么需要我帮忙的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "克罗赛尔……怎么是你？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "哎呀哎呀，这话可真伤人，人家出现在这里有什么奇怪的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你该不会又在谋划什么吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "被各自的欲望吞噬的斗士们，在斗技场上进行肉体间的激烈碰撞……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "嗯……我只是想为这样美妙的舞台，提供一些服务罢了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510009",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "这个人不太对劲……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "亲爱的伊迪丝也同意了哦——虽然周围都是她恼人的眼线。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "现在的我，只是一个普通的泳装配件店店员而已。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好吧，你有什么推荐的？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "来，先让我看看你的身体尺寸。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510014",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "唔，一下子贴得好近！",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "身材很匀称，肌肤也很光滑，平时有在做什么涂装保养吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510016",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "哈……好难为情。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这已经和挑选泳衣没关系了吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "稍等片刻，让我去取几件泳装配件。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "——这件如何？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "大胆剪裁，弹力十足的V字吊带泳装，在这个炎夏充分解放对肉体的束缚。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "呜呜……这不是只有几条带子吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "嗯，保守一些……这件呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "带荷叶裙边的三点式泳衣，可爱的同时也不失俏皮。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "上半身也只有两小块布……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "她对「保守」的理解一定有什么问题。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "那么……带薄纱外套的高叉连体泳衣，欧罗巴风格的素雅遮阳帽，夏日的一抹优雅风情。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "有点……太成熟了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "在斗技场上好像显得不够灵活。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "唔嗯，两位的要求……可真是多呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510030",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "她好像生气了，该怎么办……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "嗯？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "请问可以将货架上的那一套泳衣拿给我吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510033",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "哦？你的眼光挺不错的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "融入了水手服元素的连体泳衣，满溢青春校园的活力。唔，青春真好呢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那就是它了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510036",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "克罗赛尔",
          "text": "去换衣间试穿一下吧，需要我——帮忙吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510037",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "不、不用了！我自己来就可以!",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510038",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "过了一会儿，真乃换好了新的泳装。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510039",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "……我这身还可以吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "32510041",
              "text": "很好看。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "32510041",
              "text": "很合身。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "32510040",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32510041",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "谢谢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
