      "title": "泳装对决·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "32513001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "明天开始就是正赛了，你准备好了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "现在也没什么实感，但是，我会竭尽全力的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "如果能够坚持到最后，你会获得和上一周的冠军……和龙马对决的资格。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "是的，仓田龙马……就在这个赛事的终点。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513005",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "她和龙马的关系，真是和普通的兄妹不太一样……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "嘛，还剩下一天不到的时间，好好休息吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "明天就是连续的三场对决了，也不知道会遇上什么样的对手。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "绿子变得稳重起来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "啊哈哈有吗？难得出现了一个自己的后辈，所以忍不住开始说教了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "其实我的赛事经验也挺多的哦，可以做你的临时教练。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "谢谢你，绿子老师！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "老、老师……听到这样的称呼还真不习惯啊……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513013",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "众人在游乐园里闲逛了一段时间。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "夏日炎炎，来一支清凉舒爽的冰棍吧~数量有限，预购从速~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "面向手办的……冰棍？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "加入了薄荷和香草的清爽涂料，可选多种风味，瞬间带走身上所有的酷热~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "各位，想要来一支吗？团购还有优惠哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "请给我这份，画家小姐也想要吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "我……要红豆口味的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "多谢惠顾~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我们这要两份。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "嘿嘿，适合|101|的冰棍也有哦——说起来，刚才的比赛我看了直播。前两周的比赛我也看了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "仓田真乃……我应该没记错你的名字吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "怎、怎么了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "你真的做好了在擂台上面对那位「王者」的准备了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "我……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "你似乎并不是为了什么奖品才参赛的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "哈哈哈，表情不用这么严肃，只是随便问问。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "如果到时候，他和对待其他选手一样对待自己的妹妹……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "泉？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "泉",
          "text": "……啊，你手上的棒冰都快化了，快点享用吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513033",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "第二天上午，正赛开场。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513034",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿尔弗雷德",
          "text": "斗士们啊，告诉我你们的期待，说出你们的梦想。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513035",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿尔弗雷德",
          "text": "在这抵达极限的水上斗技场，燃烧你们的灵魂。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513036",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "阿尔弗雷德",
          "text": "在这个夏天，镌刻下最强的名号吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513037",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没想到这个人也会喊口号啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513038",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "唔，真乃第一战的对手是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513039",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "在擂台上，初战的两位选手已经就位。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513040",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "哈欠~阳光很强烈，可以活动一段时间……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513041",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "这位是——雇佣兵出身，秉持节能主义的葵选手！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32513042",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "她看起来身上都是破绽，但好像没那么简单……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-730",
